  "description": "Framework-agnostic SEO / page-audit engine: fetch a URL as a chosen user agent (SSRF-guarded), follow the redirect chain, and run a full static analysis — on-page SEO, Open Graph/Twitter, technical SEO, content metrics, a static accessibility subset, spam/hidden-CSS/JavaScript detection and cloaking — plus a composite Lighthouse-style SEO score. No Umbraco or ASP.NET Core hosting dependency; usable from any .NET app.",
