  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0: Initial release. Framework-agnostic SEO/page-audit engine for .NET 8/9/10. Provides IUrlViewerService (fetch-as-bot with SSRF guard), full static analysis (on-page SEO, Open Graph/Twitter, technical SEO, content, accessibility, spam/cloaking/JS detection), SeoScorer (Lighthouse-style composite score 0-100 with per-category sub-scores), PageAnalysisOptions, and SeoCoreExtensions.AddT4VNSeoCore() for any IServiceCollection.",
